OL,3,AFlorida Republicans fend off Democrats
OL,4,Aas state elects first black governor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two wins came amid countless - and
OL,7,Fhistoric - gains by Democrats that gave
OL,8,Fthem full control of the US House of
OL,9,FRepresentatives and the Senate for the
OL,10,Flast years of Trump's presidency.
